# This repository's primary VCS is Fossil (see .fslckout); this
# .gitignore exists only to let a separate, parallel Git remote
# publish a subset of the tree to GitHub (README, Go source under
# MWKGo/, and docs/) without dragging in the original C source,
# planning notes, or local build artifacts.

/*

!/README.md
!/compilingGo.md
!/LICENSE
!/.gitignore
!/MWKGo/
!/docs/

# Within the allowed directories, still exclude editor/OS/build
# artifacts that don't belong in the published source.
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.tmp
coverage.out
coverage.html
